WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A recording helped some participants.
But what was actually tested?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 2025, 333 people with multiple sclerosis
entered an audio-access study.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers measured fatigue impact.
Not concentration at your desk.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 offers a structured twelve-minute
course, in three different tiers.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try a free starting routine and examine
the limits of the evidence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Make a decision based on what is known.
Final Vestige Studios.
